 rewire intricate devices to progress the story.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278680/extras/52d116acd5c0786c11eb4a9a86cfec20.poster.avif?t=1770909510\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278680/extras/52d116acd5c0786c11eb4a9a86cfec20.webm?t=1770909510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278680/extras/52d116acd5c0786c11eb4a9a86cfec20.mp4?t=1770909510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One man’s trash is another man’s treasure</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Julien’s pursuit for closure will be aided by her trusty slingshot. Threats in the distorted dreamworld can be outwitted with additional, unique projectiles, including EMP stun pellets and smoke bombs to aid stealthy escapes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and creativity are rewarded in AMIGO, allowing players to tailor their approach to combat, puzzles, and NPC decisions. Scavenging for materials will allow players to upgrade and customize their slingshot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278680/extras/7a3800fb35c9ab19c022419fb0d492ee.poster.avif?t=1770909510\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278680/extras/7a3800fb35c9ab19c022419fb0d492ee.webm?t=1770909510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278680/extras/7a3800fb35c9ab19c022419fb0d492ee.mp4?t=1770909510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >